  "historyNote": "#5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; ss by #7208, eff 2-26-00; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; amd by #7578, eff 10-13-01; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 600) ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12348, eff 8-14-17; ss by #13406, eff 7-23-22; ss by #14281, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
